    {
      "bbox": [
        357,
        302,
        1330,
        369
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, in order to carry out and provide for an effective administration of the fiscal\nyear 1978 Expense and Revenue Budgets, consistent with the fiscal condition of the City and to\ninsure conformity with the City's Financial Plan, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
