      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. The term \"Agency\" as used in this Executive Order means any office, ad-\nministration, department, division, board, bureau, commission, corporation, institution or other\nunit of government, the expenses of which are paid in whole or in part from the City Treasury.",
