      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. Schedules of the appropriations contained in the Mayor's Budget Message which\naccompanied the Executive Budget, as amended by the City Council and Board of Estimate in\nadopting the Expense Budget for the 1978 fiscal year are hereby approved.",
